      "description": "Nordlys Runer uses bright, compact symbols and a playful Nordic vocabulary for the Qvitr product journey. Functionality and file formats remain unchanged.",
      "sagaTitle": "The Council of Qvitr",
      "saga": "The tools of Qvitr assembled to build the perfect Qanvas. Qugin brought knowledge from the Sagas, and Muninn promised to remember it correctly this time. The Norner shaped the parameters while Qidunn kept everything young and freshly updated. Rún carved calculations into Rúnatal, Smia forged components sturdy enough for executive meetings, and Riss drew graphics with unnecessarily dramatic arrows. Tafla arranged the final composition. Kvase inspected their work, nodded wisely, and asked whether anyone had remembered to save the file.",
